§ `ss 12, 13 -- worker and employer`

#ASSERT NOT `he is a contractor-worker under s 12(2)(c)` `Jake's delivery engagement, April 2029`
#ASSERT NOT `he is a contractor-worker under s 12(2)(c)` `a delivery contractor who employs a rider and rides none of the work himself`
#ASSERT `he is a contractor-worker under s 12(2)(c)` `a delivery contractor who employs a rider and rides some of the work himself`

#ASSERT NOT `he is a worker` `Jake's delivery engagement, April 2029`
#ASSERT `he is a worker` `the delivery engagement if the riding were not his own business`
#ASSERT `he is a worker` `Jake's employment with Sentinel, October 2053`
#ASSERT NOT `he is a worker` `an employee of a class excluded by regulation`
#ASSERT `he is a worker` `a contractor of a class prescribed a worker by regulation`

#ASSERT `the person is his employer under s 12(3)` `Jake's employment with Sentinel, October 2053` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is his employer under s 12(3)` `Jake's employment with Sentinel, October 2053` FALSE

